{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhanggu-e-r2-bujing","title":"《吴录》记卜静终于剡令","accounts":[{"id":"zhanggu-a-4925b06262389f06caed","label":"裴注·吴录","text":"《吴录》记卜静终于剡令","evidence":["zhanggu-q-352dc831c644a046bcda"]}],"participants":[{"person":"zhanggu-p0004","role":"终于剡令","evidence":["zhanggu-q-352dc831c644a046bcda"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["zhanggu-q-352dc831c644a046bcda"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhanggu-q-352dc831c644a046bcda","source_order":[52,193,75],"order":9320}],"persons":[{"id":"zhanggu-p0004","name":"卜静","evidence":["zhanggu-q-352dc831c644a046bcda","zhanggu-q-e864e38d6b8d5954a084","yululu-q-e6d7f4552ca4be9f3fb2"],"facts":[{"id":"zhanggu-f-4358adb4d13d613eef87","text":"字玄风，吴郡人。","evidence":["zhanggu-q-e864e38d6b8d5954a084"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"yululu-m-86a8bf0c01398d4b9e60","kind":"mention","text":"与吾粲同郡比肩齐声","evidence":["yululu-q-e6d7f4552ca4be9f3fb2"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"yululu-q-e6d7f4552ca4be9f3fb2","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-79dea07027e2a2ad41a0","layer":"original","quote":"吾粲字孔休，吴郡乌程人也。﹝一﹞孙河为县长，粲为小吏，河深奇之。河后为将军，得自选长吏〖1〗，表粲为曲阿丞〖2〗。迁为长史〖3〗，治有名迹。虽起孤微〖4〗，与同郡陆逊、卜静等比肩齐声矣。","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":442,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":93,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-352dc831c644a046bcda","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-43f923c806ad92e45fc1","layer":"pei","quote":"卜静，终于剡令。","attribution":"裴注·吴录","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":192,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-43837a25fd612273e2e4","start":75,"end":83,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-e864e38d6b8d5954a084","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-43f923c806ad92e45fc1","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《吴录》曰：“敦字叔方，静字玄风：并吴郡人。敦德量渊懿，清虚淡泊，又善文辞。孙权为车骑将军，辟西曹掾。转主簿。出补海昏令，甚有惠化。年三十二卒。卜静，终于剡令。”","attribution":"裴注·吴录","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":192,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-43837a25fd612273e2e4","start":0,"end":84,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
